# ── SDC_Scheduler — managed as its own standalone git repo ──────────────────
# Do NOT track this directory in the monorepo. It has its own .git pointing
# directly at danbelliveau2/SDC_Scheduler for clean bi-directional sync.
SDC_Scheduler/

# ── SDC-PowerBI-DEV — TRACKED here since 2026-09-03 ─────────────────────────
# It used to be ignored, as its own standalone repo (SDC-PowerBI)
# (and before that, a broken unregistered gitlink — a fresh clone got an empty
# folder). See docs/DEVELOPING-TOGETHER.md §5 for why it moved in. Only its
# local-only artefacts stay ignored: the .pbix working files are large binaries, and
# BACKUP/ and source-data/ are working data rather than source. The app's own
# SDC-PowerBI-DEV/.gitignore came across with it and still covers .pbi cache files.
SDC-PowerBI-DEV/BACKUP/
SDC-PowerBI-DEV/source-data/
SDC-PowerBI-DEV/**/*.pbix
SDC-PowerBI-DEV/mcp-server/bin/
SDC-PowerBI-DEV/mcp-server/obj/
SDC-PowerBI-DEV/mcp-server/publish/

# ── sdc-etc-planner (Reports) — TRACKED here since 2026-09-03 ───────────────
# It used to be ignored, as its own standalone repo (sdc-sheets).
# See docs/DEVELOPING-TOGETHER.md §5 for why it moved in, and scripts/
# sdc-main-updater.js step 7b for how it now deploys.
#
# Nothing is listed here on purpose: the app's OWN sdc-etc-planner/.gitignore came
# across with it and already covers everything local. Its root-anchored patterns
# (/node_modules, /.next/, /.next-verify*/, .env*) anchor to that directory rather
# than to the repo root, which is exactly right for a nested ignore file.

# ── Dependencies ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# ── Environment / secrets (NEVER commit credentials) ─────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
**/.env
**/.env.local

# ── SQLite databases (generated at runtime) ───────────────────────────────────
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
sessions.db

# ── Build outputs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
dist-electron/
release/
build/
**/dist/
**/client/dist/
out/
# Allow apps/shell/build/ — it holds static Electron icon source assets, not build output
!apps/shell/build/
!apps/shell/build/**

# ── Electron-builder artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.exe
*.dmg
*.AppImage
*.snap

# ── Logs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
npm-debug.log*

# ── OS / editor junk ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
.vs/
*.swp
*.swo

# ── Claude internal files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/

# ── Thumbnails (generated by Assemblies sync — large binary files) ────────────
**/thumbnails/*.jpg
**/thumbnails/*.png
**/thumbnails/*.jpeg

# ── Backup files ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
backups/
*.bak

# ── Scratch / one-time scripts & local dev artefacts ─────────────────────────
scratch/
**/scratch/
check-sqlite.js
_icongen/
central/
server version/

# ── Sensitive documents (employee lists, contracts, patents) ──────────────────
*Employee List*
*employee list*
Patent/
**/Patent/

# ── Misc binaries & zips ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.zip
GoogleDriveSetup.exe

# ── Test artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
playwright-report/
test-results/
coverage/

# ── Vite cache ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vite/
**/.vite/

# ── Auto-updater sync state (runtime, not source) ─────────────────────────────
**/.update-sha

# ── The old per-app .git directories, kept as a recovery path ────────────────
#
# sdc-etc-planner and SDC-PowerBI-DEV moved into this repo on 2026-09-03. Their
# original .git directories are RENAMED rather than deleted (7.1 MB and 596 KB), so
# the pre-move history is still on this box if the subtree merge ever needs undoing.
#
# Renamed, not left in place, because a live nested .git is a footgun: `cd
# sdc-etc-planner && git commit` would have silently committed to the old
# sdc-sheets repo instead of here, and with two people working that mistake is a
# matter of time. This monorepo is the only remote now.
#
# Safe to delete once the move has settled.
sdc-etc-planner/.git-archived-sdc-sheets/
SDC-PowerBI-DEV/.git-archived-sdc-powerbi/
